377
00:26:16.435 --> 00:26:17.967
(DR. CORTEZ SPEAKING SPANISH)

378
00:26:27.807 --> 00:26:29.946
(BREATHING DEEPLY)

379
00:26:45.191 --> 00:26:47.392
